{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/TracingDestinations\/documentation\/TracingDestinations","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"module","modules":[{"name":"TracingDestinations"}],"title":"TracingDestinations","externalID":"TracingDestinations","role":"collection","roleHeading":"Framework"},"abstract":[{"text":"A destination that adds each tracked event to the span that was active when it was tracked.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/tracingdestinations"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TracingDestinations\/documentation\/TracingDestinations\/SpanEventDestination"],"title":"Destinations","anchor":"Destinations"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TracingDestinations\/documentation\/TracingDestinations\/SpanEventDestination"},{"text":" finds each record’s span from the ","type":"text"},{"code":"ServiceContext","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" the event was tracked","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in, so a delivery that runs later, under another span or none, still adds the event to the right","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"one. Each span event is named after the event, stamped with the time it was tracked, and carries","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the event’s description under ","type":"text"},{"code":"event","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and its call site under OpenTelemetry’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"code.*","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" attribute","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"names.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Span events can’t be added to a span that has ended. A record tracked outside any span, or whose","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"span ended before its batch was delivered, is left out. Batch tightly enough for your spans to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"outlive their batches, and deliver to another destination as well for the events that must not be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"lost. To write events to your logs instead, use ","type":"text"},{"code":"LoggerDestination","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"LoggingDestinations","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"module.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let tracker = Tracker()","let delivery = tracker.records.batch().deliver(to: SpanEventDestination(tracer: tracer))","let span = tracer.startSpan(\"checkout\")","ServiceContext.withValue(span.context) {","    tracker.track(SignedUp(plan: \"pro\"))","}","await tracker.finish()","try await delivery.execute()","span.end()"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The umbrella guide on this area is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://TracingDestinations/documentation/TracingDestinations/SpanEventDestination":{"title":"SpanEventDestination","abstract":[{"text":"A destination that adds each event to the span that was active when the event was tracked.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/tracingdestinations\/spaneventdestination","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SpanEventDestination"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SpanEventDestination"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/TracingDestinations\/documentation\/TracingDestinations\/SpanEventDestination","type":"topic"},"https://tyler-keith-thompson.github.io/Traffluent/documentation/traffluent/choosingdestinations":{"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Choosing Destinations"}],"url":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations","type":"link","title":"Choosing Destinations"},"doc://TracingDestinations/documentation/TracingDestinations":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/tracingdestinations","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A destination that adds each tracked event to the span that was active when it was tracked."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/TracingDestinations\/documentation\/TracingDestinations","title":"TracingDestinations"}}}